{"reference":"Jeremiah 22","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":22,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"A Later Signet Image","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The removal of Coniah as a signet in verses 24–30 is later set in striking contrast with Haggai’s description of Zerubbabel as God’s chosen servant and signet, an image carrying royal-Davidic significance without saying that Zerubbabel became king. The shared image makes the contrast worth noticing, but it cannot by itself prove that Haggai deliberately reversed Jeremiah’s oracle.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 22:24-30"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_022_5009f151beacd5046d7d24a2"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Jeremiah in Its Larger Book","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"Jeremiah 22 appears within a received book that brings together poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. This broad outline describes the book’s present form without deciding how its long compositional and textual history developed.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 10:1-25","Jeremiah 11:1-23","Jeremiah 12:1-17","Jeremiah 13:1-27","Jeremiah 14:1-22","Jeremiah 15:1-21","Jeremiah 16:1-21","Jeremiah 17:1-27","Jeremiah 18:1-23","Jeremiah 19:1-15","Jeremiah 1:1-19","Jeremiah 20:1-18","Jeremiah 21:1-14","Jeremiah 23:1-40","Jeremiah 24:1-10","Jeremiah 25:1-38","Jeremiah 26:1-24","Jeremiah 27:1-22","Jeremiah 28:1-17","Jeremiah 29:1-32","Jeremiah 2:1-37","Jeremiah 30:1-24","Jeremiah 31:1-40","Jeremiah 32:1-44","Jeremiah 33:1-26","Jeremiah 34:1-22","Jeremiah 35:1-19","Jeremiah 36:1-32","Jeremiah 37:1-21","Jeremiah 38:1-28","Jeremiah 39:1-18","Jeremiah 3:1-25","Jeremiah 40:1-16","Jeremiah 41:1-18","Jeremiah 42:1-22","Jeremiah 43:1-13","Jeremiah 44:1-30","Jeremiah 45:1-5","Jeremiah 46:1-28","Jeremiah 47:1-7","Jeremiah 48:1-47","Jeremiah 49:1-39","Jeremiah 4:1-31","Jeremiah 50:1-46","Jeremiah 51:1-64","Jeremiah 52:1-34","Jeremiah 5:1-31","Jeremiah 6:1-30","Jeremiah 7:1-34","Jeremiah 8:1-22","Jeremiah 9:1-26"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_022_b5414d80047b17ddda8f0624"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}